@startuml api-bet-orders
title GET /api/bet/orders & GET /api/bet/orders/{id} — logic swimlanes

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Client|
start
:GET /api/bet/orders\nor GET /api/bet/orders/{id}\nHeader **X-User-Access-Token** only (raw JWT; no Bearer prefix);

|PredictionOrderController|
:requireAuthenticatedUser() via **RequiresFoundationUser**;
|UserFoundationGateway|
:Memo / cache / GET **/api/user/me**;
|PredictionOrderController|
:Extract **uid** via **FoundationUser::id**;

|PredictionOrderController|
if (index?) then (yes)
  :Clamp **per_page**;
  |Eloquent **BetOrder**|
  :Query **where uid**\n**orderByDesc id**\n**paginate**;
  :Map items to summary DTOs;
else (show)
  |Eloquent **BetOrder**|
  :**where id + uid**\n**with('lines')**\n**first**;
  if (missing?) then (yes)
    :throw **ModelNotFoundException**;
    stop
  endif
  :**BetOrderApiArray::detail**;
endif

|PredictionOrderController|
:Call **MallDictionaryService** resolve(['bet_order_status']);
:**logHandledApiRequest**;
:Return **ApiResponse::ok**;

|Client|
:200 JSON;
stop

@enduml
